#: 7899dac740174c2b9e42d96217ca7cb7
msgid "Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:159
#: 860c21c6115441f1b99b64315772941c
msgid "Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the xxxxxxxxxx.apj firmware files."
msgstr ""

